# QA captures — none of them, at any depth. `qa/*.png` only ever matched the
# TOP level, so every PNG written into a subdirectory was tracked by default,
# which is how qa/pass/ came to hold 29 MB of a 33 MB repository.
#
# THE HERO SHOTS ARE NO LONGER TRACKED EITHER, and that was a deliberate call
# rather than an oversight. They were 26 curated frames, one per chapter, added
# in the root commit and never touched again, referenced by nothing — 87 % of
# the weight of a repository that is about to be published. They still exist on
# the author's disk; they are simply not the repository's problem. See
# REVIEW-2026-08-31.md.
qa/**/*.png
